        "status": "final",
        "code": {
          "text": "Right shoulder range of motion"
        },
        "subject": {
          "reference": "Patient/patient-1"
        },
        "valueString": "Active flexion approximately 120°, limited by pain. Abduction approximately 90–100°, with a painful arc from approximately 60–120°. Internal rotation behind the back is limited; unable to reach the bra strap. Passive range of motion near full, with pain but no hard stop."
      }
    },
    {
      "fullUrl": "https://example.org/fhir/Observation/observation-11",
      "resource": {
